{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le13ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I called this meeting to talk about what has been going on at the Bistro lately. First, we have an excellent crew here. You provide exceptional service to the customers and are first-rate to work with. That said, I have found that things are getting a little loose around here and I want to get everyone back on point. For example, people need to call me if they can't make it in.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: But we were in a car accident. If  fender benders didn't happen, we would never be late.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm glad you guys are OK, but you still have to let me know. Last night, could have been a disaster.  If the people here last night had not busted their behinds  the restaurant's reputation would have taken a big hit. Every time you forget to phone in, the restaurant's reputation is at stake!  Also, we would miss out on big corporate paydays if staff didn't come to work.", "id": 1, "time": "50", "image": "engenn10le13ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: But I was really sick. If I felt better, I'd come to work, but yesterday, I didn't.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure we have all gotten sick, but before I decide to stay home, I call in and let people know!  Give me a call once you've decided. If you called in before your shift began, we would have time to find someone to take your shift. If you guys weren't so late so often we wouldn't be in this mess.\nThat's why you three will be on probation until you've learned to be more conscientious.", "id": 2, "time": "59000", "image": "engenn10le13ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel and Michael</span>: That's not right!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: That's not fair. I was one of your best employees before any of this happened.  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Rachel. I know you are hard working, diligent and good at what you do, but you have to call. If you had called me, we wouldn't be having this conversation.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: Vanessa. I'm starting to feel that I am not appreciated around here. So, I quit.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Alexander and Michael</span>: So do we.", "id": 3, "time": "93000", "image": "engenn10le13ob05re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le13ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le13ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about relationships and character traits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about hypothetical situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can link an event to another using words like  <span class=\"italic\">every time</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">once</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">before</span>, and  <span class=\"italic\">until</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had a conflict with a colleague? What happened?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What strategy do you use to deal with conflicts?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"